<title>NORWAY: Norway Sept foreign trade surplus NOK 8.09 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway Sept foreign trade surplus NOK 8.09 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes ships and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE     SEPT 1996   AUG 1996   SEPT 1995</p>
<p> Imports			   18.33	 16.17	 17.47</p>
<p> Exports			   26.42	 25.66	 21.11</p>
<p> Balance			    8.09	  9.49	  3.65</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas	     -5.78	 -3.85	 -5.07</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
